@startuml
title Interaction check - state machine (with approval)
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Checking : doctor submits list
Idle --> Refused : 0 or more than 10 drugs
Refused --> Idle
Checking --> Success : interactions found
Checking --> NotFound : unknown drug / no data
Checking --> Degraded : LLM unavailable or circuit open
Success --> PendingApproval : HIGH interaction found
Success --> Idle : result shown (no HIGH)
PendingApproval --> Approved : doctor approves
PendingApproval --> Rejected : doctor rejects
Approved --> Saved : schedule saved
Saved --> Idle
Rejected --> Idle
NotFound --> Idle
Degraded --> Idle

note right of PendingApproval
  Model cannot approve.
  Quote + source shown.
  No answer = stays not reviewed.
end note

note bottom of Refused
  Code status names: REFUSED, PENDING_APPROVAL,
  APPROVED, SAVED, REJECTED, DEGRADED.
  The lab server's BLOCKED state is not used
  in the doctor version (ADR-0002).
end note

@enduml
